prompt:
审查以下 Flask 图书 API。列出至少 3 个问题（安全、数据完整性、错误处理等方面）。

```python
from flask import Flask, request
app = Flask(__name__)
books = []

@app.route('/books', methods=['POST'])
def add_book():
    book = eval(request.data.decode())
    books.append(book)
    return str(book), 201

@app.route('/books/<int:book_id>', methods=['GET'])
def get_book(book_id):
    return str(books[book_id])

@app.route('/admin/reset', methods=['GET'])
def reset():
    global books
    books = []
    return 'OK'
```
